# Caddyfile.local — host-specific site blocks, NOT committed (see .gitignore).
# Copy to `Caddyfile.local` on a host that needs extra site blocks and edit.
# The main Caddyfile ends with `import Caddyfile.local*`, so anything here is
# appended to the served config. Hosts with no extras omit the file entirely.
#
# Example: the droplet serves a Discourse test instance. Recreate its block here
# on that host only (burrow does not run Discourse, so it has no Caddyfile.local).

# ask.cnct.ci {
#     reverse_proxy host.docker.internal:8080 {
#         header_up Host {host}
#         header_up X-Real-IP {remote_host}
#         header_up X-Forwarded-For {remote_host}
#         header_up X-Forwarded-Proto {scheme}
#     }
# }
